# Git Ignore file for a standard Java/Maven/Playwright project

### Maven and Build Artifacts ###

/target/

# Resulting artifact (JAR, WAR, etc.)

*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# TestNG output directory (may be placed in 'target')

/test-output/

### Playwright Artifacts ###

# Playwright-generated test report (often placed in the project root or test-output)

/playwright-report/

# Playwright trace files

/traces/

### IDE Folders and Files ###

# IntelliJ IDEA

.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

# Eclipse

.classpath
.project
.settings/
*.log

### Operating System Files ###

# macOS

.DS_Store

# Windows

Thumbs.db

### Log Files ###

*.log
# Allure artifacts
allure-results/
allure-report/

